From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2025 14:34:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: preserve wpa_supplicant socket on teardown

Removing the socket path sometimes cuases reconf issues.

Fixes: OWRT-8872

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 src/lib/netifd/hostapd.sh |    2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/lib/netifd/hostapd.sh
+++ b/src/lib/netifd/hostapd.sh
@@ -1231,7 +1231,7 @@ _wpa_supplicant_common() {
 
 wpa_supplicant_teardown_interface() {
 	_wpa_supplicant_common "$1"
-	rm -rf "$_rpath/$1" "$_config"
+	rm -rf "$_config"
 }
 
 wpa_supplicant_prepare_interface() {
